    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@value": "For a second summer, FLIP Fabrique’s artists joins the Ex Mure public art space: Les passages insolites. Always on the verge of beeing plausible, the FLIP Fabrique’s artists blend into the neighborhood and have fun with the street furniture. An electrician repairs a lamppost balanced on a ladder, a yoga instructor incorporates flips into his […]"
      }
